Let $R$ be a standard rigid cover of $i(b)$ and $z$ a $\mathcal
G$-\v{C}ech cocycle of degree $q\ge1$ on $R$. Then $z$ is
cohomologous within $R$ \textup{(}no refinement\textup{)} to a
